# Copy to .env.local in this directory (apps/console/.env.local, gitignored
# via the repo's .env* rule — never commit the real file) and restart the
# dev server. See README.md's Setup section for context.

# Base Sepolia (chain 84532) RPC endpoint the browser uses for every read
# and write the maker console makes. Optional -- falls back to Base
# Sepolia's shared public RPC if unset, but that endpoint rate-/size-limits
# requests ("Request exceeds defined limit") once more than a couple of
# strategy cards are polling at once. From Alchemy, Infura, or any other
# provider's dashboard -- free tier is enough for this. Must be prefixed
# with NEXT_PUBLIC_ since wagmi's config runs in the browser, not just at
# build time.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=
